{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44105","headline":"赠卢夫人 · 常浩","name":"赠卢夫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳人惜颜色，恐逐芳菲歇。\n日暮出画堂，下堦拜新月。\n拜月如有词，傍人那得知。\n归来投玉枕，始觉泪痕垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}